ployment, which starts new isolates.\n\nArchitecture: sound. One function behind the existing gate removes about half of grow's requests, and the insert-only rule that makes it safe is now written down and tested.\n\nSimplification: no required change.\n\nWhat I checked:\n\n- The gate. END 0ed0843b passed at this head. The last lines of `gate.txt` read \"gate passed\" and \"exit=0\".\n- Scope. The 8 artifacts name the head, no path repeats, and their paths equal `git diff --no-renames --name-only a7acfdf2 05ffba87`.\n- Cheap checks. The commit-message check passes: 1 checked, 0 flagged. `check-notes` gives 0 warnings, and `git diff --check` is clean. I ran only the new static check.\n\nFact for the planner's deployment: deploy the room Workers and read the rate with `scripts/do-rate.mjs`. Expect ScopeIndex on dap-grow to fall from about 24 to 2-5 a minute once the isolates are warm.\n\nThis approval authorizes no push, landing or deployment. The planner decides the landing.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:a834b04f9703f0e249e241baa41f217de46e6a49","binding":"assigned","head":"05ffba871c570980492a032040e9b65fd3b2be94","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:484cb40a1a537efc19fb13afe7e349038bab9549\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:feda2d6c59ea94368aa21d9ac043c7e1956d5bba\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:b12f2613e835db153e9c9ce32c4863347ffb37fa","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"approved"}}